</div></div></div></div></div><main data-v-a238cbe0="" class="container1"><section data-v-a238cbe0="" class="banner-wrap flex flex-col items-center justify-center"><picture data-v-a238cbe0="" aria-hidden="true" class="banner-picture"><source data-v-a238cbe0="" media="(max-width: 1199px)" type="image/avif" srcset="https://p.cdn.izhaoli.cn/gc/web/static/opti/homebg.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize%2Cw_960/format%2Cavif"><source data-v-a238cbe0="" type="image/avif" srcset="https://p.cdn.izhaoli.cn/gc/web/static/opti/homebg.webp?x-oss-process=image/format%2Cavif"><source data-v-a238cbe0="" media="(max-width: 1199px)" type="image/webp" srcset="https://p.cdn.izhaoli.cn/gc/web/static/opti/homebg.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize%2Cw_960"><img data-v-a238cbe0="" src="https://p.cdn.izhaoli.cn/gc/web/static/opti/homebg.webp" alt="" width="1440" height="816" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async"></picture><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="max-1200"><h1 data-v-a238cbe0="" class="text-h1 font-bold text-center text-gray-900 mb-10 mt-12 first-transform text-transform visible"> 用 AI 加速优质内容的全球流动 </h1><p data-v-a238cbe0="" class="text-xl text-center mb-10 w800 !mx-auto first-transform2 text-transform visible"> 提供一站式视频译制工作台，包括精准字幕生成、无痕文字擦除、免费大模型翻译、超真实克隆配音、AI音乐处理和批量合成压制等环节。助力企业高效、高质的覆盖全球市场。 </p><a data-v-a238cbe0="" href="/login/" class="btn btn-primary btn-start1 !mx-auto first-transform2 text-transform visible">开始免费试用</a></div></section><section data-v-a238cbe0="" class="section-wrap flex flex-col items-center justify-center mb-16 first-transform3 text-transform visible"><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="max-1200"><h2 data-v-a238cbe0="" class="text-[56px] font-bold text-center text-gray-900 mb-10 mt-12"> 一站式视频译制工作台 </h2><p data-v-a238cbe0="" class="text-xl text-center mb-10 w800 mx-auto"> 搭载强大 AI 底层，深度优化译制体验，真正实现质效飞跃 </p></div></section><section data-v-a238cbe0="" class="project-swiper-wrap relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center mb-44"><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="max-1200"><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="mbwrap flex justify-between"><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="left-pages-wrap"><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="pages-list flex justify-start items-center active mb-5"><span data-v-a238cbe0="" class="p-num">01</span><span data-v-a238cbe0="" class="p-title">项目管理</span></div><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="pages-list flex justify-start items-center mb-5"><span data-v-a238cbe0="" class="p-num">02</span><span data-v-a238cbe0="" class="p-title">字幕打轴</span></div><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="pages-list flex justify-start items-center mb-5"><span data-v-a238cbe0="" class="p-num">03</span><span data-v-a238cbe0="" class="p-title">字幕翻译</span></div><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="pages-list flex justify-start items-center mb-5"><span data-v-a238cbe0="" class="p-num">04</span><span data-v-a238cbe0="" class="p-title">字幕擦除</span></div><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="pages-list flex justify-start items-center mb-5"><span data-v-a238cbe0="" class="p-num">05</span><span data-v-a238cbe0="" class="p-title">字幕编辑与角色标记</span></div><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="pages-list flex justify-start items-center mb-5"><span data-v-a238cbe0="" class="p-num">06</span><span data-v-a238cbe0="" class="p-title">语音克隆与 AI 配音</span></div><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="pages-list flex justify-start items-center"><span data-v-a238cbe0="" class="p-num">07</span><span data-v-a238cbe0="" class="p-title">编辑与合成</span></div></div><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="right-swiper-wrap"><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="right-swiper-container swiper-initialized swiper-horizontal swiper-backface-hidden"><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="swiper-wrapper"><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="swiper-slide swiper-slide-active" style="width: 900px;"><p data-v-a238cbe0="" class="project-h3">可按项目管理众多素材和作品，支持同时上传、翻译成百上千的视频。</p><img data-v-a238cbe0="" src="https://p.cdn.izhaoli.cn/gc/web/static/20250709/One-Stop-Workflow-Project-Management.jpg" alt="stopworkflow" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="project-imgs"></div><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="swiper-slide swiper-slide-next" style="width: 900px;"><p data-v-a238cbe0="" class="project-h3">ASR 和 OCR 批量识别，支持 100 多种语言，具备强大抗噪，抗干扰能力，准确度极高。<a data-v-a238cbe0="" target="_blank" href="https://cn.jollytoday.com/subtitle-generator/" class="learn_more">进一步了解→</a></p><img data-v-a238cbe0="" src="https://p.cdn.izhaoli.cn/gc/web/static/20250709/One-Stop-Workflow-Subtitle-Generation.jpg" alt="stopworkflow" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="project-imgs"></div><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="swiper-slide" style="width: 900px;"><p data-v-a238cbe0="" class="project-h3">采用 DeepSeek 等领先 AI 模型和多 Agent 的翻译审校工作流，显著提升翻译准确性。<a data-v-a238cbe0="" target="_blank" href="https://cn.jollytoday.com/subtitle-translator/" class="learn_more">进一步了解→</a></p><img data-v-a238cbe0="" src="https://p.cdn.izhaoli.cn/gc/web/static/2027070901/One-Stop-Workflow-Subtitle-Translation.jpg" alt="stopworkflow" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="project-imgs"></div><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="swiper-slide" style="width: 900px;"><p data-v-a238cbe0="" class="project-h3">自动移除视频中的字幕、人名条和文字水印等，效果无痕，画面美观。<a data-v-a238cbe0="" target="_blank" href="https://cn.jollytoday.com/subtitle-removal/" class="learn_more">进一步了解→</a></p><img data-v-a238cbe0="" src="https://p.cdn.izhaoli.cn/gc/web/static/20250709/One-Stop-Workflow-Subtitle-Removal-zh.jpg" alt="stopworkflow" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="project-imgs"></div><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="swiper-slide" style="width: 900px;"><p data-v-a238cbe0="" class="project-h3">支持在线编辑字幕并标记角色，用AI自动识别视频多说话人的角色名。<a data-v-a238cbe0="" target="_blank" href="https://cn.jollytoday.com/srt-online-editor/" class="learn_more">进一步了解→</a></p><img data-v-a238cbe0="" src="https://p.cdn.izhaoli.cn/gc/web/static/20250709/One-Stop-Workflow-SRT-Online-Editor.jpg" alt="stopworkflow" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="project-imgs"></div><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="swiper-slide" style="width: 900px;"><p data-v-a238cbe0="" class="project-h3">提供欧美、日韩、东南亚等数十种语言的超真实 AI 配音，并支持声音克隆。<a data-v-a238cbe0="" target="_blank" href="https://cn.jollytoday.com/voice-cloning-and-dubbing/" class="learn_more">进一步了解→</a></p><img data-v-a238cbe0="" src="https://p.cdn.izhaoli.cn/gc/web/static/20250709/One-Stop-Workflow-Voice-Cloning-Dubbing.jpg" alt="stopworkflow" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="project-imgs"></div><div data-v-a238cbe0="" class="swiper-slide" style="width: 900px;"><p data-v-a238cbe0="" class="project-h3">自动完成视频字幕、音频、音乐等渲染合成，用 AI 精准对齐，并支持导出所有剪辑工程文件。</p><img data-v-a238cbe0="" src="https://p.cdn.izhaoli.cn/gc/web/static/20250709/One-Stop-Workflow-Export-Download.jpg" alt="stopworkflow" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="project-imgs"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-v-a238cbe0="" class="partnership-swiper-wrap relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center mb-[200px]"><h3 data-v-a238cbe0="" class="mb-16">拥有超过 2,000,000+ 全球创作者和企业的信赖</h3><div data-v-cc879fd8="" data-v-a238cbe0="" class="partnership-swiper-container"><ul data-v-cc879fd8="" class="partnership-list" style="transform: translateX(-28.6px);"><li data-v-a238cbe0="" data-v-cc879fd8=""><img data-v-a238cbe0="" data-v-cc879fd8="" src="https://p.cdn.izhaoli.cn/gc/web/static/20250514/imgs/dreame.png" alt="dreame" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="partnership-imgs"></li><li data-v-a238cbe0="" data-v-cc879fd8=""><img data-v-a238cbe0="" data-v-cc879fd8="" src="https://p.cdn.izhaoli.cn/gc/web/static/20250514/imgs/eclicktech.png" alt="eclicktech" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="partnership-imgs"></li><li data-v-a238cbe0="" data-v-cc879fd8=""><img data-v-a238cbe0="" data-v-cc879fd8="" src="https://p.cdn.izhaoli.cn/gc/web/static/20250514/imgs/ecovacs.png" alt="ecovacs" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="partnership-imgs"></li><li data-v-a238cbe0="" data-v-cc879fd8=""><img data-v-a238cbe0="" data-v-cc879fd8="" src="https://p.cdn.izhaoli.cn/gc/web/static/20250514/imgs/fujitsu.png" alt="fujit